# The engine's own lint configuration. Every other directory that is linted
# carries its own; see dev-docs/STRUCTURE.md. Entries are anchored to this
# directory: an unanchored pattern matches a directory of that name at any depth.

# Common files
node_modules

# 3rd party
/src/interpreter/plugin/3rdparty

# Configurations
*.config.js
/.config/
/karma.*
/test/_setupFiles/*.js

# Scripts, not linted
/script

# The source language packs, deliberately, and only for now.
#
# The old ignore list carried a bare `languages` entry, meant for the build
# output. An unanchored pattern matches a directory of that name at ANY depth,
# so it also excluded src/i18n/languages/ - and the `sort-keys` override that
# targets those files has therefore never run. Anchoring the build-output entry
# below exposed 881 pre-existing violations in them.
#
# Sorting 19 translation files is a change of its own, not a side effect of
# moving directories around. Delete this entry in that change.
/src/i18n/languages

# Auto-generated directories
/commonjs
/coverage
/dist
/es
/languages
/lib
/test-jasmine
/test-jest
/typings
/doc
/typedoc
